// Native Delphi-style VCL editor for Fruity Reeverb 2.
// Reproduces the original FL Studio control rendering: TVectorWheel, TVectorSlider,
// TSwitchSelector, and TVectorCheckBox — no generic JUCE or standard Windows knobs.

